w.\n\nTerms: धातु", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["न व्यो लिटि ६.१.४६", "६.१.४६", "६.१.४६ न व्यो लिटि"], "synonyms_slp1": ["na vyo liwi ६.१.४६", "६.१.४६", "६.१.४६ na vyo liwi"]}], "na gosvantsavavarRaraqaNkruNkfdByaH": [{"id": "na goSvantsAvavarRarAqaNkruNkfdByaH", "headword": "न गोश्वन्त्साववर्णराडङ्क्रुङ्कृद्भ्यः", "headword_slp1": "na goSvantsAvavarRarAqaNkruNkfdByaH", "fold": "na gosvantsavavarRaraqaNkruNkfdByaH", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The foregoing rules from ६.१.१६८ downwards have no applicability after गो , and श्वन् and words ending in them; nor after a stem which before the case ending of the Nominative Singular has अ or आ , nor after रज् , or after a stem ending in अञ्च् , nor as well as after कुञ्च् and कृत्।\n\nTerms: accent-विभक्ति", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["न गोश्वन्त्साववर्णराडङ्क्रुङ्कृद्भ्यः ६.१.१८२", "६.१.१८२", "६.१.१८२ न गोश्वन्त्साववर्णराडङ्क्रुङ्कृद्भ्यः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["na goSvantsAvavarRarAqaNkruNkfdByaH ६.१.१८२", "६.१.१८२", "६.१.१८२ na goSvantsAvavarRarAqaNkruNkfdByaH"]}], "na BuvakcidiDisu": [{"id": "na BUvAkciddiDizu", "headword": "न भूवाक्चिद्दिधिषु", "headword_slp1": "na BUvAkciddiDizu", "fold": "na BuvakcidiDisu", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The words भू , वाक् , चित् and दिधिषू however do not preserve their original accent in तत्-पुरुष समास when coming before the word पति denoting 'master' or 'lord'.\n\nTerms: तत्-पुरुष समास", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["न भूवाक्चिद्दिधिषु ६.२.१९", "६.२.१९", "६.२.१९ न भूवाक्चिद्दिधिषु"], "synonyms_slp1": ["na BUvAkciddiDizu ६.२.१९", "६.२.१९", "६.२.१९ na BUvAkciddiDizu"]}], "na ButaDikasanjivamadrasmakajalam": [{"id": "na BUtADikasaMjIvamadrASmakajjalam", "headword": "न भूताधिकसंजीवमद्राश्मकज्जलम्", "headword_slp1": "na BUtADikasaMjIvamadrASmakajjalam", "fold": "na ButaDikasanjivamadrasmakajalam", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The following words do not get acute accent (उदात्त) on the first syllable when standing before अर्म etc. - 1. भूत 2. अधिक 3. संजीव 4. मद्र 5. अश्मन् and 6. कञ्जल।\n\nTerms: समास 1st-acute", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["न भूताधिकसंजीवमद्राश्मकज्जलम् ६.२.९१", "६.२.९१", "६.२.९१ न भूताधिकसंजीवमद्राश्मकज्जलम्"], "synonyms_slp1": ["na BUtADikasaMjIvamadrASmakajjalam ६.२.९१", "६.२.९१", "६.२.९१ na BUtADikasaMjIvamadrASmakajjalam"]}], "na hastinaPalakamardeyaH": [{"id": "na hAstinaPalakamArdeyAH", "headword": "न हास्तिनफलकमार्देयाः", "headword_slp1": "na hAstinaPalakamArdeyAH", "fold": "na hastinaPalakamardeyaH", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "But when the words 1. हास्तिन 2. फलक and 3. मार्देय precede पुर , the acute accent (उदात्त) does not fall on their final.\n\nTerms: समास end acute-1st-term", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["न हास्तिनफलकमार्देयाः ६.२.१०१", "६.२.१०१", "६.२.१०१ न हास्तिनफलकमार्देयाः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["na hAstinaPalakamArdeyAH ६.२.१०१", "६.२.१०१", "६.२.१०१ na hAstinaPalakamArdeyAH"]}], "na guRadayovayavaH": [{"id": "na guRAdayo'vayavAH", "headword": "न गुणादयोऽवयवाः", "headword_slp1": "na guRAdayo'vayavAH", "fold": "na guRadayovayavaH", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "In a बहुव्रीहि समास , after बहु the acute accent (उदात्त) does not fall on the final of गुण etc. when they appear in the compound as ingredient of something else.\n\nTerms: समास end acute-2nd-term", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["न गुणादयोऽवयवाः ६.२.१७६", "६.२.१७६", "६.२.१७६ न गुणादयोऽवयवाः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["na guRAdayo'vayavAH ६.२.१७६", "६.२.१७६", "६.२.१७६ na guRAdayo'vayavAH"]}], "na niviByam": [{"id": "na niviByAm", "headword": "न निविभ्याम्", "headword_slp1": "na niviByAm", "fold": "na niviByam", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The word अन्तर् does not have acute accent (उदात्त)