्यायीवेपाम्"], "synonyms_slp1": ["na BABUpUkamigamipyAyIvepAm ८.४.३४", "८.४.३४", "८.४.३४ na BABUpUkamigamipyAyIvepAm"]}], "na padantaworanam": [{"id": "na padAntAwworanAm", "headword": "न पदान्ताट्टोरनाम्", "headword_slp1": "na padAntAwworanAm", "fold": "na padantaworanam", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "After टु final in a पद , the change of a dental (स्तु) to a cerebral (ष्टु), does not take place, except in the case of the affix नाम्।\n\nTerms: सन्धि-हल्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["न पदान्ताट्टोरनाम् ८.४.४२", "८.४.४२", "८.४.४२ न पदान्ताट्टोरनाम्"], "synonyms_slp1": ["na padAntAwworanAm ८.४.४२", "८.४.४२", "८.४.४२ na padAntAwworanAm"]}]}